+/*
+ * These sysfs knobs (GPU mux, RGB keyboard mode, fan boost) are all
+ * unsupported/nonfunctional on the thin-ultrabook line (0xE0 on a
+ * full command sweep) - hide them for quirked devices instead of
+ * using ATTRIBUTE_GROUPS(), which cannot express per-device
+ * visibility.
